    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing File Infrastructure**\n\nI'm currently focused on setting up the initial file structure, specifically the `summarize_text.py` file with AWS integration using boto3 and Amazon Bedrock. I'm exploring the best approach for connecting with the Bedrock service. Concurrently, I'm generating placeholder files for the other nine required Python files, as a baseline for the project.\n\n\n**Initiating Code Implementation**\n\nI've begun implementing `summarize_text.py`. I'm using `boto3` to connect to AWS Bedrock and have started crafting a function for text summarization. I'm focusing on defining a function that will handle text input and produce a summary, with specific `boto3` integration to signal AWS Bedrock. I'm going to start with a suitable model like `anthropic.claude-3-sonnet-20240229-v1:0` or `meta.llama2-70b-v1`.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789829139621,
          "start": 1789829137042
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0ba214292001rMxvxEamiQ0NRH",
      "message_id": "msg_0ba213ca400176dIYxSyxWelVI",
      "session_id": "ses_f45dec3e6ffehGA25r88pFAovF",
      "time_created": 1789829137042,
      "time_updated": 1789829139621
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "zDtCSJPHBoYusluq",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\nimport json\nimport os\n\ndef summarize_text(text: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Summarizes the given text using AWS Bedrock.\n    \"\"\"\n    client = boto3.client(\n        \"bedrock-runtime\",\n        region_name=os.environ.get(\"AWS_REGION\", \"us-east-1\"),\n        aws_access_key_id=os.environ.get(\"AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID\"),\n        aws_secret_access_key=os.environ.get(\"AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY\"),\n    )\n\n    model_id = \"anthropic.claude-3-sonnet-20240229-v1:0\"\n    \n    # The prompt for summarization\n    prompt = f\"\"\"Human: Summarize the following text:\n\n<text>{text}</text>\n\nAssistant:\"\"\"\n\n    body = json.dumps({\n        \"anthropic_version\": \"bedrock-2023-05-31\",\n        \"max_tokens\": 1000,\n        \"messages\": [\n            {\n                \"role\": \"user\",\n                \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": prompt}]\n            }\n        ]\n    })\n\n    response = client.invoke_model(\n        body=body,\n        modelId=model_id,\n        accept=\"application/json\",\n        contentType=\"application/json\"\n    )\n\n    response_body = json.loads(response.get(\"body\").read())\n    summary = response_body[\"content\"][0][\"text\"]\n    return summary\n",
            "filePath": "summarize_text.py"
          },
